It does not bundle the Tiendanube / Nuvemshop developer documentation, which is
not published under an open license. The search-docs and read-doc tools fetch
it live from https://nuvemshop.dev/ and https://tiendanube.dev/, the Markdown
versions the site publishes for agents.

The files in data/ are factual indexes built by scripts/ingerir.ts from that
documentation: HTTP methods, endpoint paths, resource names, OAuth scope names,
webhook event names and links to the source pages. No text of the
documentation is included.

The code generated by the scaffold tools is original and follows the
documented flows (OAuth authorization code, webhook signature).

